SF0122 Voyeurism-sex offender registration amendment.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Cooper, Crago, Dockstader and Olsen and
Representative(s) Connolly
AN ACT relating to criminal procedure; amending the requirement for persons
convicted of felony voyeurism to register as a sex offender; and providing for
an effective date.
